SELECT e.id, 4, 9.84, 13.34, 'and then we literally just watched a movie, had some popcorn.', '然后我们刚刚看了一部电影，吃了点爆米花。', '/ænd ðɛn wiː lɪɾɚɹəli dʒʌst wɑːtʃt ɐ muːvi, hæd sʌm pɑːpkɔːɹn./', '<span>and</span><span>then</span><span>we</span><span tid="10915" class="highlight highlight-a">literally</span><span>just</span><span tid="10917">watched</span><span>a</span><span tid="10919">movie,</span><span>had</span><span>some</span><span tid="10922" class="highlight highlight-a">popcorn.</span>'
