SELECT e.id, 18, 73.98, 80.58, 'and just the complimentary nature of all of these artworks was great to see.', '这些艺术作品的互补性真的很棒，值得一看。', '/ænd dʒʌst ðə kɑːmplɪmɛntɚɹi neɪtʃɚɹ ʌv ɔːl ʌv ðiːz ɑːɹtwɜːks wʌz ɡɹeɪt tə siː./', '<span>and</span><span>just</span><span>the</span><span tid="34973" class="highlight highlight-a">complimentary</span><span tid="34974">nature</span><span>of</span><span>all</span><span>of</span><span>these</span><span tid="34979">artworks</span><span>was</span><span tid="34981">great</span><span>to</span><span tid="34983">see.</span>'
