SELECT e.id, 16, 62.8, 69.3, 'Now, before we get into the business strategy, which is super interesting and a little surprising. I''m not here to yank your chain.', '在我们进入非常有趣、甚至有些出人意料的商业策略之前，我不是来耍你的。', '/naʊ, bᵻfɔːɹ wiː ɡɛt ɪntʊ ðə bɪznəs stɹæɾədʒi, wɪtʃ ɪz suːpɚɹ ɪntɹɛstɪŋ ænd ɐ lɪɾəl sɚpɹaɪzɪŋ. aɪm nɑːt hɪɹ tə jæŋk jʊɹ tʃeɪn./', '<span tid="31067">Now,</span><span tid="31068">before</span><span>we</span><span pid="957" class="highlight highlight-d">get into</span><span>the</span><span pid="947" class="highlight highlight-c">business strategy,</span><span>which</span><span>is</span><span tid="31077" class="highlight highlight-a">super</span><span tid="31078">interesting</span><span>and</span><span>a</span><span tid="31081">little</span><span tid="31082">surprising.</span><span pid="959" class="highlight highlight-l">I''m not here to</span><span pid="958" class="highlight highlight-f">yank your chain.</span>'
