SELECT e.id, 2, 2.2800000000000002, 7.18, 'right now I''m heating up some potatoes from last night because I''m gonna eat them with eggs.', '现在我在加热昨晚剩下的土豆，因为我要和鸡蛋一起吃。', '/ɹaɪt naʊ aɪm hiːɾɪŋ ʌp sʌm pəteɪɾoʊz fɹʌm læst naɪt bɪkʌz aɪm ɡənə iːt ðɛm wɪð ɛɡz./', '<span tid="30385" class="highlight highlight-a">right</span><span tid="30386">now</span><span>I''m</span><span pid="1870" class="highlight highlight-d">heating up</span><span>some</span><span tid="30391" class="highlight highlight-a">potatoes</span><span>from</span><span pid="1871" class="highlight highlight-c">last night</span><span>because</span><span>I''m</span><span tid="30397">gonna</span><span tid="30398">eat</span><span>them</span><span>with</span><span tid="30401">eggs.</span>'
