SELECT e.id, 90, 416.4, 421.62, 'Listen, I was like 17 or 18. so not gonna hate on myself too much for that.', '听着，我那时候大概17、18岁，所以也不打算太责怪自己。', '/lɪsən, aɪ wʌz laɪk sɛvəntiːn ɔːɹ eɪtiːn. soʊ nɑːt ɡənə heɪt ɔn maɪsɛlf tuː mʌtʃ fɔːɹ ðæt./', '<span tid="129028">Listen,</span><span>I</span><span>was</span><span>like</span><span>17</span><span>or</span><span>18.</span><span>so</span><span>not</span><span tid="129037">gonna</span><span tid="129038">hate</span><span>on</span><span tid="129040">myself</span><span>too</span><span tid="129042">much</span><span>for</span><span>that.</span>'
