SELECT e.id, 49, 213.1, 218.1, 'Whereas in Friends, they''re either dressed in jeans or casual jumpers.', '而在《老友记》中，他们要么穿着牛仔裤，要么穿着休闲毛衣。', '/wɛɹæz ɪn fɹɛndz, ðeɪɚɹ iːðɚ dɹɛst ɪn dʒiːnz ɔːɹ kæʒuːəl dʒʌmpɚz./', '<span tid="126239" class="highlight highlight-a">Whereas</span><span>in</span><span tid="126241">Friends,</span><span>they''re</span><span tid="126243">either</span><span tid="126244">dressed</span><span>in</span><span tid="126246">jeans</span><span>or</span><span tid="126248" class="highlight highlight-a">casual</span><span tid="126249" class="highlight highlight-a">jumpers.</span>'
