SELECT e.id, 102, 424.86, 428.62, 'She''s wearing this beaded necklace, which is very stone and everything is kind of simple and minimal.', '她戴着一条珠饰项链，非常符合石头风格，一切都很简单、极简。', '/ʃiːz wɛɹɪŋ ðɪs biːdᵻd nɛkləs, wɪtʃ ɪz vɛɹi stoʊn ænd ɛvɹɪθɪŋ ɪz kaɪnd ʌv sɪmpəl ænd mɪnɪməl./', '<span>She''s</span><span tid="126986">wearing</span><span>this</span><span tid="126988" class="highlight highlight-a">beaded</span><span tid="126989" class="highlight highlight-a">necklace,</span><span>which</span><span>is</span><span>very</span><span tid="126993">stone</span><span>and</span><span tid="126995">everything</span><span>is</span><span tid="126997">kind</span><span>of</span><span tid="126999">simple</span><span>and</span><span tid="127001" class="highlight highlight-a">minimal.</span>'
