SELECT e.id, 35, 153.78, 158.52, 'If you''ve never heard the word trait before, essentially a trait is a characteristic.', '如果你从未听说过“特征”这个词，本质上它指的是一个特性。', '/ɪf juːv nɛvɚ hɜːd ðə wɜːd tɹeɪt bᵻfɔːɹ, ᵻsɛnʃəli ɐ tɹeɪt ɪz ɐ kæɹɪktɚɹɪstɪk./', '<span>If</span><span>you''ve</span><span tid="124520">never</span><span tid="124521">heard</span><span>the</span><span tid="124523">word</span><span tid="124524" class="highlight highlight-a">trait</span><span tid="124525">before,</span><span tid="124526" class="highlight highlight-a">essentially</span><span>a</span><span tid="124528" class="highlight highlight-a">trait</span><span>is</span><span>a</span><span tid="124531" class="highlight highlight-a">characteristic.</span>'
