 tid="49719" class="highlight highlight-a">fold,</span><span tid="49720" class="highlight highlight-a">roll,</span><span tid="49721" class="highlight highlight-a">wheel,</span><span>and</span><span pid="2985" class="highlight highlight-c">satellite dish.</span>'
