SELECT e.id, 48, 249.34, 253.379, 'but the dress is worth it, and I can just buy a new bed sheet.', '但这条裙子值得，我可以再去买新的床单。', '/bʌt ðə dɹɛs ɪz wɜːθ ɪt, ænd aɪ kæn dʒʌst baɪ ɐ nuː bɛd ʃiːt./', '<span>but</span><span>the</span><span tid="47776">dress</span><span>is</span><span tid="47778">worth</span><span>it,</span><span>and</span><span>I</span><span>can</span><span>just</span><span tid="47784">buy</span><span>a</span><span tid="47786">new</span><span pid="656" class="highlight highlight-c">bed sheet.</span>'
