SELECT e.id, 63, 332.34, 336.04, 'and it can also help it dye more evenly.', '而且还能让染色更均匀。', '/ænd ɪt kæn ɔːlsoʊ hɛlp ɪt daɪ mɔːɹ iːvənli./', '<span>and</span><span>it</span><span>can</span><span>also</span><span tid="47970">help</span><span>it</span><span tid="47972" class="highlight highlight-a">dye</span><span>more</span><span tid="47974" class="highlight highlight-a">evenly.</span>'
