SELECT e.id, 29, 122.34, 127.86, 'Because on Earth, like I am right now, gravity is naturally causing my blood to move away from my brain.', '因为在地球上，像我现在这样，重力自然地让我的血液远离大脑。', '/bɪkʌz ɔn ɜːθ, laɪk aɪɐm ɹaɪt naʊ, ɡɹævᵻɾi ɪz nætʃɚɹəli kɔːzɪŋ maɪ blʌd tə muːv ɐweɪ fɹʌm maɪ bɹeɪn./', '<span>Because</span><span>on</span><span tid="141066">Earth,</span><span>like</span><span>I</span><span>am</span><span tid="141070" class="highlight highlight-a">right</span><span tid="141071">now,</span><span tid="141072" class="highlight highlight-a">gravity</span><span>is</span><span tid="141074">naturally</span><span tid="141075" class="highlight highlight-a">causing</span><span>my</span><span tid="141077">blood</span><span>to</span><span tid="141079">move</span><span tid="141080">away</span><span>from</span><span>my</span><span tid="141083">brain.</span>'
